<title>USA: PIA says former CFO Olofson resigned.</title>
<headline>PIA says former CFO Olofson resigned.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PIA Merchandising Services Inc said former chief financial officer Roy Olofson resigned for personal reasons.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company said it named Cathy Wood as its new chief financial officer.  She was previously chief financial officer, secretary and treasurer at Giant Group Ltd.</p>
